{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<div class=\"text_box\">\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">[00:35]<br/>天文台：預料強陣風繼續吹襲香港。呼籲如身處室外，應到安全地方躲避。在凌晨零時30分左右，大澳錄得每小時約70公里的強陣風。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-05T16:57:59.413260+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":69,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"unknown"}}